---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/games.mjs';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — TabArcade';
const description = 'TabArcade privacy policy: no user accounts, local storage only for play history, no sale of personal data.';
const canonical = 'https://tabarcade.online/privacy/';
---

<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <div class="crumbs">
    <a href={u()}>Home</a> › Privacy Policy
  </div>

  <article class="prose" style="margin-top: 16px;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      We believe in honest, transparent privacy practices. Here is exactly what data TabArcade uses and how it works.
    </p>

    <h2>No User Accounts or Passwords</h2>
    <p>
      TabArcade has no user accounts, profiles, registration forms, or login systems. You do not need an email, username,
      or password to play games on our site.
    </p>

    <h2>Local Storage on Your Device Only</h2>
    <p>
      Features such as "Jump back in" (your recently played games) store a small list of game titles and URLs directly
      in your web browser's local storage (<code>localStorage</code>) on your own device. This information stays entirely
      on your machine, is never sent to our servers, and can be cleared at any time through your browser's history settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Game Providers &amp; Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      Games on TabArcade are embedded via iframes and served directly by licensed HTML5 game distribution platforms,
      including GameMonetize. These providers and their advertising partners may collect standard
      web browsing technical data (such as IP addresses, browser user agents, and cookies) according to their own privacy
      policies in order to deliver game content and serve ads.
    </p>

    <h2>No Sale of Personal Data</h2>
    <p>
      TabArcade does not sell, rent, trade, or monetize personal information. We do not track visitors across other websites.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy or our data practices, please reach out via email at
      <a href="mailto:hongrun01@gmail.com">hongrun01@gmail.com</a> or visit our <a href={u('contact/')}>contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
